# Tinybones, Bauble Burglar: "{3}{B}, {T}: Each opponent discards a card" needs black mana, not just four (CR 118.1, 202.1). Bot1
# casts Tinybones on turn 1 and on turn 3 spends its Swamp's {B} on Duress (Bot2's hand is all lands, so it takes nothing),
# leaving only Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl, Mox Sapphire and Mox Emerald: four mana, none of it black, so the ability is refused.
# Mox Jet, cast and tapped, makes it payable. Bot2 discards a Mountain and it is exiled with a stash counter; Bot1 may play it,
# a card it doesn't own, from exile as its land play on its own turn (CR 305.1, 601.3): it enters Bot1's battlefield, and
# Bot2's other Mountain, discarded to its hand size at the end of turn 2 the same way, stays in exile.

